51:02.640 --> 51:05.360
basically someone who's telling
his thousand friends

51:05.360 --> 51:07.760
or more, hey, check this out.

51:07.760 --> 51:09.040
I really love this guy.

51:09.040 --> 51:10.200
In fact, I love it so much

51:10.200 --> 51:12.840
and I'm gonna play it back to
back five times.

51:12.840 --> 51:14.520
That is a great feeling.

51:14.520 --> 51:17.120
That's what motivates people, I
think, more than money

51:17.120 --> 51:20.440
